menu "brim"

config BRIM_BENCH
    bool "Bench build: never deep-sleep, USB console always on"
    default n
    help
        For bring-up on the bench. Wherever brim would deep-sleep it stays awake instead, keeps the USB console
        and logging running, and restarts itself (the equivalent of a wake-up) when water reaches the wake pad,
        it is put on or lifted off the charger, it is tapped, or the sleep timer runs out.
        Uses a lot more battery: never ship it. Build: sdkconfig.bench (see firmware/README.md).

endmenu
